    "detailed_description": "Inspired by SEGA's Virtua Racing, Super Retro GP is a modern retro arcade racing game featuring a clean flat shaded polygon retro aesthetic with modern lighting effects to help it stand out without losing the retro charm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent available features are:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4 unlocked cars with Different Handling Characteristics: Choose from a variety of vehicles, each with unique handling.<br />\r\n4 unlocked courses<br />\r\nArcade Mode: Experience fast-paced racing action reminiscent of old-school arcades.<br />\r\nTime Attack: Test your skills against ghost cars and aim for the best lap times.<br />\r\nGhost cars<br />\r\n20 CPU racers<br />\r\nForward, reverse, mirrored and reverse mirrored course configurations<br />\r\nDynamic Time of Day Effects: Watch the lighting change as you race through different times of day.<br />\r\nLeaderboards for fastest lap and goal time per course<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompatible with force feedback steering wheels and pedals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures to be released during early access:<br />\r\n16 more cars to unlock<br />\r\n6 more courses to unlock<br />\r\nGrand Prix Mode: Compete in championship races across various courses.<br />\r\nEndurance mode<br />\r\nOnline multiplayer",
